  "notable_quotes": [
    "Zn(Py)(Atz) can be recycled seven times with little loss in product yield, indicating strong reusability for CO2 cycloaddition.",
    "Zn(Py)(Atz) shows decent CO2 uptake of 52.3 cm3/g at 273 K, aided by abundant micropores and N-rich functionality.",
    "Catalysis is attributed to acid-base synergy: Zn sites activate epoxides, while free pyridyl/amino groups, micropores, and N-rich units promote CO2 adsorption/activation."
